   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Review of Internal Control of Checks and Balances Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att genomf&#xf6;ra en granskning av intern f&#xf6;rvaltning och kontroll av Checks and Balances Network f&#xf6;r att underl&#xe4;tta f&#xf6;r ett framtida bidrag. Granskningen g&#xf6;r det &#xe4;ven l&#xe4;ttare att identifiera risker samt specificera vissa villkor och f&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden f&#xf6;r det planerade beslutet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to perform a Review of Internal Management and Control of Checks and Balances Network in order to facilitate on a foreseen contribution and identify the risks and to specify certain terms and conditions for the foreseen decision.</narrative>
  </description>
